    "text": "<p>Gibbs energy vs <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></math> plot for the formation of oxides is given below.</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/87579dd3-d191-49a9-8e9e-d0f644507629.png\" style=\"width: 450px; height: 392px;\" /></p><p>For the given diagram, the correct statement is-</p>",
